{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19922","headline":"雪 · 孟郊","name":"雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽然太行雪，昨夜飞入来。\n崚嶒堕庭中，严白何皑皑。\n奴婢晓开户，四肢冻徘徊。\n咽言词不成，告诉情状摧。\n官给未入门，家人尽以灰。\n意劝莫笑雪，笑雪贫爲灾。\n将暖此残疾，典卖争致杯。\n教令再举手，夸曜余生才。\n强起吐巧词，委曲多新裁。\n爲尔作非夫，忍耻轰暍雷。\n书之与君子，庶免生嫌猜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}